Based on the reviewer’s request, we have now included an evaluation of the FlexTok model. This comparison was conducted shortly after receiving the request and builds upon our already comprehensive baseline coverage and fair evaluation methodology.

To ensure a meaningful comparison, we cloned the official FlexTok repository and evaluated their smallest available model, which includes 12 encoder and 12 decoder layers—significantly larger than our architecture, which uses only 8 encoder and 8 decoder layers. All experiments were conducted on the ImageNet100 dataset for consistency.

